Alastair Moss is one of the project leads of the [[Org/Embercall Industries/index|Embercall]]'s research on the [[Voidsong]], named in the company's logs. He works the project the Embercall calls Entrainment, which means to reach the source of the Voidsong and change what emits it rather than the song it sends out.

He was the last to sign the [[Phenomena/Void Atlas|void atlas]] out of [[Org/The Harlequins/People/Ocelith|Ocelith]]'s library at [[Org/The Harlequins/Harlequin Town|Harlequin Town]], about six months before the Party did. He appears to have got the book through the Harlequins and the [[Phenomena/Pilgrimage|pilgrimage]] rather than through the library's own shelves.
